          <li class="list-group-item">Custom property editors, dashboards and backoffice extensions</li>
          <li class="list-group-item">Headless and Content Delivery API implementations</li>
          <li class="list-group-item">Azure hosting, deployment pipelines and environment setup</li>
          <li class="list-group-item">Performance tuning, caching and search</li>
          <li class="list-group-item">Ongoing maintenance through a <a href="/services/website-care-plans">care plan</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
